<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$55 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$55 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian promissory note issuers offloaded A$55 million worth of short-dated paper via tender on Friday.</p>
<p>McDonald's Corp's Australian subsidiary fared best on the day selling A$20 million of its 31-day paper roughly in line with the mid rate for late October bank bills.</p>
<p>Other issues went at two to six basis points over bill</p>
<p>Investor interest remained greatest in 30-day paper, dealers said.</p>
